      "sha": "856e57ab908ea28177f7750a7313dedd375eb2ae",
      "message": "feat(search): add whole-word and regex matching to utility functions\n\nAdd `wholeWord` and `regexp` options to `SearchOptions`. Whole-word uses\n\\b boundaries; regex mode passes the query as a raw pattern with graceful\nhandling of invalid expressions (returns empty results).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
      "date": "2026-06-17T05:37:10Z"
    },
    {
      "sha": "1905df029a6b5a6795d8ea53ed12622647c12173",
      "message": "feat(react,vue): add onReady callback and container pass-through props\n\nBoth `<Editor />` components now accept `onReady` (called with EditorAPI\nafter initialization), plus `className`/`style`/`id` (React) and\n`class`/`style`/`id` (Vue) forwarded to the container div.\n\nThe `useEditor` hook also supports `onReady` in its config object.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
      "date": "2026-06-17T06:00:40Z"
    }
  ],
